{
  "title": "Days of Hana",
  "description": "Friends since childhood, Haru and Hana do not have a typical relationship -- Hana is human, and Haru is her werewolf who must protect her. Although werewolves are starting to have more rights, they are still seen as exotic beasts by society. As the two fall in love, what will be their fate?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: Abuse, Adoption, Bullying, Cohabitation, Comedy, Dark Past, Discrimination, Drama, Fantasy, Female Protagonist, Guns, High School, Jealousy, Kemonomimi, Love Triangle, Master-Pet Relationship, Philosophy, Politics, Prejudice, Primarily Teen Cast, Romance, Sadistic Character, Scarred Protagonist, Scars, School, School Life, Shoujo, Supernatural, Torture, 21st century, Animal Transformation, Childhood Friends, Female Lead, Forbidden Love, Full Color, Heterochromia, Heterosexual, Human-Nonhuman Relationship, Interspecies Relationship, Korean Folklore, Longstrip, Male Lead, Male Lead Falls in Love First, Manhwa, Non-human, Non-Human Protagonist, Oppression, Shape-Shifter, Slice of Life, South Korea, Tragedy, Tragic Past, Web Comic, Werewolves, Male Protagonist, Slavery",
